From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:42:49 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Saturn: Arc-style sidebar layout (phase 1)

Vertical tabs on by default; toolbar (nav buttons, URL pill, sliders menu,
sidebar toggle) moves into the 258px sidebar; 25px Saturn title bar; page
shown as a rounded inset card; design colors, 38px tab rows, New tab row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
